sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario
    participant React as Frontend (React)
    participant API as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Prisma (PostgreSQL)

    U->>React: Introduce credenciales
    React->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Busca usuario por 'name'
    DB-->>API: Retorna hash de password
    API->>API: Verifica bcrypt.compare()
    alt Credenciales válidas
        API->>API: Genera JWT (Token)
        API-->>React: 200 OK + { token, user }
        React->>React: AuthContext guarda token en LocalStorage
        React-->>U: Redirige al Dashboard
    else Credenciales inválidas
        API-->>React: 401 Unauthorized
        React-->>U: Muestra error en pantalla
    end
